{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30016_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:112cc1b404de830899f7e78e3facc3154e6ce9f1195db2f5d04c26e8781019ef",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000021:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3e293b5ee93389a9b7bcf17a66b7f6a2d54b67552eb5a995eeb1189d5833170",
      "text": "初中时代……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94cc51ce5f741020d10c1724b537487e901e73c0f3bd48b27d4ec1ec861a8643",
      "text": "……今天又跟老爹吵了一架。真是的，\n我早说了自己根本不想当职业摔角手啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:865b5d0e494b8ce2f15b9d122df4e910dacce814a96d038d530a6380fbd7eb29",
      "text": "看来还是一如既往啊。不过，看着现在的你，\n想要让你继承家业的心情我也能理解。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0177b90f0d719d00548b36eaf42ac3f007c9ab5a81f48ffeb717d0bed3a51bf",
      "text": "毕竟像朱雀这么热血又强大的男人，世上可没几个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc0f4d7758057180d7580048d3b0d385784c02722e27ddb1840aa4eaff6f746d",
      "text": "嘿嘿。……那玄武家里怎么样？\n大家关系都好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65b98e63cb604c791023c1b542dcc278e63232062dd64f75ebd4e16944d62f97",
      "text": "嗯？谁知道呢。\n我父母在很久以前就已经过世了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71ea0163c44f9f630f23698296cabc0733a2bfa2890170c7a8150ee3e3873fb2",
      "text": "连长相都不记得了。之前可能没和你说过，\n我是在福利机构长大的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "text": "……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90f44d2b6ebd9a57ec1190ab4911c6ee2a33c6cd6c93e6de4a3322221071cac1",
      "text": "呵，吓到你了吗。现在我受一位有些渊源的\n熟人照顾，正一个人生活呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:505931a2b290b4bad8d660d1aaac9d4962587d086687cb3c013d73b2fb86616d",
      "text": "原来是这样啊。\n……虽然我不知情，但真是对不住了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c477b70073ae91f7f45e3f63223cfe6dfb9868bc0677a106233dcfaf96984dcc",
      "text": "别在意。\n我也觉得没必要特意提起，所以一直没说而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
